    "booking_limits_q": "What should I know before booking?",
    "booking_limits_a": "Availability is limited to one primary event per date. Travel up to 40 driving miles from Strongsville is included. For venues farther away, confirm your travel charge with us before paying the retainer. Larger celebrations and custom presentation requests may require a separate quote.",
