    "magnet_event_a": "Yes. Order custom photo magnets directly from the shop in sets of 6, 12, 24, or 48.",
    "magnet_upload_q": "How do I upload my photographs?",
    "magnet_upload_a": "Choose your set on the photo magnet product page, upload one image per magnet, and adjust your square crops before checkout.",
