  "audit_returns": {
    "title": "Returns & cancellations",
    "q1": "Can I return custom magnets or a keepsake frame?",
    "a1": "Custom magnets and personalized frames are final sale for change-of-mind returns. Non-personalized frames may be returned if requested within 14 days of delivery, unused, undamaged, and securely packaged. You pay return shipping; original shipping is not refundable except where required by law. No restocking fee applies. For frame-and-magnet sets, see the product page for the refundable frame portion and discount allocation.",
    "q2": "What if my order arrives damaged or incorrect?",
    "a2": "Email support@atelierelunora.com with your order number, a description, and photos where possible. We will arrange an appropriate replacement or refund and cover required return shipping for a confirmed defect or our error. This includes custom items. Applicable consumer rights are unaffected.",
    "q3": "Can I cancel a custom product order?",
    "a3": "You may cancel for a full refund before design or production work begins. Email support@atelierelunora.com as soon as possible. Live wedding and event bookings follow the terms provided in your event agreement."
